getNetAum.t.sol
├── when call is reentrant
│  └── it should revert
└── when call is not reentrant
   ├── given one of the positions in the caliber is stale
   │  └── it should revert with PositionAccountingStale
   └── given no position in the caliber is stale
      ├── it should account for all base-token positions
      ├── it should ignore balances of tokens that are not registered as base tokens
      ├── it should account for all positions, debt and non-debt
      └── it should return the caliber net AUM
